From d7c14c5f569c6c7e9b3d4ae8c8099eeb0cd04895 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:13:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/15] test-posix: Check the Bessel functions' errors and
 special values

test-j0-errors checks j0, j1 and jn for NaN, +Inf, zero, huge arguments
and underflow; test-y0-errors checks y0, y1 and yn for NaN, negative
arguments, the pole at zero (with +HUGE_VAL for negative odd n),
+Inf, overflow, and y0 and y1 against yn.

Signed-off-by: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
---
